  "dcterms:title": "Genotyping-by-sequencing dataset of spongy moth laboratory colonies from Eurasia and North America",
  "dcterms:description": "This dataset contains genotyping-by-sequencing genotypes at 2 327 SNPs for 91 spongy moths (Lymantria dispar) from eight laboratory-reared colonies whose original stocks were collected in Asia, Europe and North America, covering the three subspecies L. d. dispar, L. d. asiatica and L. d. japonica.",
